<template>
  <section class="tools"><div class="heading"><div><p>数据维护</p><h1>数据工具</h1><span>把重复录入交给选择、AI 和批量工具。</span></div></div>
    <p v-if="notice" class="notice" role="status">{{ notice }}</p>
    <section class="card card--wide server-status-card" aria-labelledby="server-status-title">
      <div class="server-status-heading"><div><p>运行状态</p><h2 id="server-status-title">服务器当前状态</h2><span>这里显示本次解析真正依赖的服务，不需要猜是否生效。</span></div><button data-refresh-status type="button" class="secondary" :disabled="statusBusy" @click="refreshServerStatus">{{ statusBusy ? '刷新中…' : '刷新状态' }}</button></div>
      <div v-if="serverStatus" class="server-status-grid">
        <div class="server-status-item"><span>后端接口</span><strong :class="serviceTone(serverStatus.backend.status === 'ok')">{{ serverStatus.backend.status === 'ok' ? '在线' : '异常' }}</strong><small>Schema v{{ serverStatus.backend.schemaVersion }}</small></div>
        <div class="server-status-item"><span>{{ modelLabel(serverStatus.deepseek.model) }}</span><strong :class="serviceTone(serverStatus.deepseek.configured)">{{ serverStatus.deepseek.configured ? '已配置' : '未配置' }}</strong><small>{{ serverStatus.deepseek.configured ? '可以进行模型分析' : '将使用规则兜底' }}</small></div>
        <div class="server-status-item"><span>淘宝文字解析</span><strong :class="serviceTone(serverStatus.taobao.enabled && serverStatus.taobao.browserAvailable)">{{ taobaoStatusLabel(serverStatus.taobao) }}</strong><small>{{ serverStatus.taobao.stateSaved ? '已保存服务器登录状态' : '未保存淘宝登录状态' }}</small></div>
      </div>
      <p v-if="statusError" class="status-error" role="alert">状态读取失败：{{ statusError }}</p>
    </section>
    <section class="card card--wide taobao-login-card"><h2>淘宝登录（可选）</h2><p>如果淘宝页面要求登录，可以在服务器浏览器中完成一次登录。登录状态只保存在服务器，不会显示或提交 Cookie。</p><div class="taobao-login-actions"><button data-taobao-start type="button" :disabled="taobaoBusy" @click="startTaobao">{{ taobaoSession ? '重新打开登录' : '打开淘宝登录' }}</button><button v-if="taobaoSession" type="button" class="secondary" @click="clearTaobao">清除登录状态</button></div><p v-if="taobaoSession" class="taobao-login-status">{{ taobaoSession.ready ? '已检测到登录，可以保存状态。' : '请在下方服务器浏览器画面中完成登录。' }}<small>当前页面：{{ taobaoSession.url }}</small></p><div v-if="taobaoSession" class="taobao-browser"><img :src="taobaoScreenshot" alt="服务器上的淘宝登录页面" @pointerdown="startBrowserPointer" @pointerup="finishBrowserPointer" /><div class="taobao-browser-tools"><input v-model="taobaoText" type="password" autocomplete="off" placeholder="先点击登录框，再在这里输入文字" @keydown.enter.prevent="sendTaobaoText" /><button type="button" @click="sendTaobaoText">发送文字</button><button type="button" @click="sendTaobaoKey('Enter')">回车</button><button type="button" @click="saveTaobao" :disabled="!taobaoSession.ready">保存登录状态</button></div></div></section>
    <div class="grid"><section class="card"><h2>DeepSeek 密钥</h2><p>密钥只写入服务器 <code>.env</code>，不会显示、下载或保存到浏览器。</p><input data-field="deepseek-key" v-model="deepSeekKey" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="粘贴 DeepSeek API Key" /><button data-action="save-deepseek-key" type="button" :disabled="!deepSeekKey.trim()" @click="saveKey">保存密钥</button><small>{{ keyStatus }}</small></section>
      <section class="card"><h2>DeepSeek 预判</h2><p>输入一个礼物名称，先查看模型建议，再回到录入页确认。</p><input v-model="aiName" placeholder="例如：南京博物院文创书签" /><select v-model="aiType"><option value="product">商品</option><option value="activity">活动</option></select><button type="button" @click="runAI">开始预判</button><pre v-if="aiResult">{{ JSON.stringify(aiResult, null, 2) }}</pre></section>
      <section class="card card--wide"><h2>批量解析商品链接</h2><p>每行一个公开链接，最多 20 条。系统只生成待审核建议，不会直接写入数据库。</p><textarea data-batch-links v-model="batchLinks" rows="6" placeholder="https://…&#10;https://…" /><select v-model="batchType"><option value="product">商品</option><option value="activity">活动</option></select><button data-analyze-links type="button" :disabled="batchBusy || !batchLinks.trim()" @click="analyzeLinks">{{ batchBusy ? '解析中…' : '解析链接并检查重复' }}</button><div v-if="batchItems.length" class="batch-results"><article v-for="item in batchItems" :key="item.url"><div class="batch-result-heading"><div><strong>{{ item.suggestedName || '未识别名称' }}</strong><small>{{ item.url }}</small></div><span :class="['status-chip', extractionTone(item.status)]">{{ extractionStatusLabel(item.status) }}</span></div><p v-if="item.sourceRef?.error" class="status-error">{{ item.sourceRef.error }}</p><div v-if="item.sourceRef" class="batch-source-meta"><span>来源：{{ item.sourceRef.label || item.url }}</span><small v-if="item.sourceRef.extractionMode">提取方式：{{ item.sourceRef.extractionMode === 'playwright-text-only' ? '服务器浏览器文字模式' : '网页文字模式' }}</small></div><details v-if="item.sourceRef" open class="batch-source"><summary>解析内容</summary><dl><template v-if="item.sourceRef.title"><dt>页面标题</dt><dd>{{ item.sourceRef.title }}</dd></template><template v-if="item.sourceRef.description"><dt>页面描述</dt><dd>{{ item.sourceRef.description }}</dd></template><template v-if="item.sourceRef.priceHints?.length"><dt>价格提示</dt><dd>{{ item.sourceRef.priceHints.join('、') }} 元</dd></template></dl><p v-if="item.sourceRef.text" class="batch-source-text">{{ item.sourceRef.text }}</p><p v-else class="muted">没有抓到可展示的正文文字，可能需要登录或人工验证。</p></details><details v-if="item.patches.length" open class="batch-fields"><summary>AI 建议字段 · {{ item.patches.length }} 条</summary><div v-for="patch in item.patches" :key="patch.path" class="batch-field"><span>{{ patch.label }}</span><strong>{{ formatPatchValue(patch.value) }}</strong><small>{{ patch.reason || '请人工核对后再填入' }} · {{ Math.round(patch.confidence * 100) }}%</small></div></details><div v-if="item.questions?.length" class="batch-questions"><strong>还需要确认</strong><ul><li v-for="question in item.questions" :key="question">{{ question }}</li></ul></div><p v-if="item.duplicates.some(match => match.exact)" class="danger">发现完全重复：{{ item.duplicates.find(match => match.exact)?.canonical_name }}</p><p v-else-if="item.duplicates.length" class="warning">发现相似资料：{{ item.duplicates[0].canonical_name }}</p><p v-else class="muted">未发现明显重复</p><button data-review-batch-item type="button" @click="reviewBatchItem(item)">到录入页人工审核</button></article></div></section>
      <section class="card"><h2>自定义字段</h2><p>字段先定义一次，后续采集同学就能按统一格式填写。</p><div class="row"><input v-model="field.machineKey" placeholder="machine_key，如 eco_score" /><input v-model="field.displayName" placeholder="显示名称" /></div><select v-model="field.valueType"><option value="text">文本</option><option value="number">数字</option><option value="boolean">是/否</option><option value="select">选项</option></select><button type="button" @click="addField">添加字段</button><ul><li v-for="item in fields" :key="item.id">{{ item.displayName }} <small>{{ item.machineKey }} · {{ item.valueType }}</small></li></ul></section>
      <section class="card"><h2>全库重复扫描</h2><p>同时检查完全同名和高相似度记录，不会自动删除或合并。</p><button type="button" @click="scanAllDuplicates">开始扫描</button><p v-if="duplicateScanDone && !duplicatePairs.length">未发现明显重复资料。</p><ul v-else><li v-for="pair in duplicatePairs" :key="`${pair.left.id}-${pair.right.id}`">{{ pair.left.canonical_name }} ↔ {{ pair.right.canonical_name }} <small>{{ pair.exact ? '完全重复' : `相似度 ${Math.round(pair.similarity * 100)}%` }}</small></li></ul></section>
      <section class="card"><h2>批量导入 / 导出</h2><p>Excel 第一行使用：name、type、status、description、price_min、price_max、tags。</p><button type="button" @click="download('/api/export/xlsx', 'giftmind-gifts.xlsx')">导出 Excel</button><label class="file">选择 Excel 导入<input type="file" accept=".xlsx" @change="importExcel" /></label><label class="file">恢复备份<input type="file" accept=".zip" @change="restoreBackup" /></label><button type="button" @click="download('/api/backup', 'giftmind-backup.zip')">下载备份</button></section>
    </div>
  </section>
</template>

<script setup lang="ts">
import { computed, onMounted, onUnmounted, reactive, ref } from "vue";
import { useRouter } from "vue-router";
import { analyzeBatchLinks } from "../api/assistant";
import type { BatchLinkItem } from "../api/assistant";
import type { GiftTypeCode } from "../api/gifts";
import { scanGiftDuplicates } from "../api/gifts";
import type { DuplicatePair } from "../api/gifts";
import { clearTaobaoLogin, completeTaobaoLogin, createCustomField, deepSeekStatus, downloadBlob, getServerStatus, listCustomFields, saveDeepSeekKey, startTaobaoLogin, taobaoLoginAction, taobaoLoginScreenshotUrl, taobaoLoginStatus, suggestGift, uploadFile } from "../api/tools";
import type { ServerStatus, TaobaoLoginSession } from "../api/tools";
const router = useRouter();
const notice = ref(""); const fields = ref<Awaited<ReturnType<typeof listCustomFields>>>([]); const aiName = ref(""); const aiType = ref<GiftTypeCode>("product"); const aiResult = ref<unknown>(null); const deepSeekKey = ref(""); const keyStatus = ref("检查中…"); const field = reactive({ machineKey: "", displayName: "", valueType: "text" });
const batchLinks = ref(""); const batchType = ref<GiftTypeCode>("product"); const batchBusy = ref(false); const batchItems = ref<BatchLinkItem[]>([]);
const duplicatePairs = ref<DuplicatePair[]>([]); const duplicateScanDone = ref(false);
const taobaoSession = ref<TaobaoLoginSession | null>(null); const taobaoBusy = ref(false); const taobaoText = ref(""); const taobaoScreenshotNonce = ref(0); let taobaoTimer: ReturnType<typeof setInterval> | undefined; let browserPointerStart: { x: number; y: number } | null = null;
const serverStatus = ref<ServerStatus | null>(null); const statusError = ref(""); const statusBusy = ref(false);
const taobaoScreenshot = computed(() => taobaoSession.value ? taobaoLoginScreenshotUrl(taobaoSession.value.sessionId, taobaoScreenshotNonce.value) : "");
async function loadFields() { fields.value = await listCustomFields(); }
function modelLabel(model: string) { return model === "deepseek-v4-flash" ? "DeepSeek V4 Flash" : model; }
async function refreshServerStatus() { statusBusy.value = true; try { serverStatus.value = await getServerStatus(); statusError.value = ""; keyStatus.value = `${serverStatus.value.deepseek.configured ? "已配置" : "尚未配置"} · ${modelLabel(serverStatus.value.deepseek.model)}`; } catch (error) { statusError.value = error instanceof Error ? error.message : "服务器状态暂时无法读取"; } finally { statusBusy.value = false; } }
async function saveKey() { if (!deepSeekKey.value.trim()) return; const result = await saveDeepSeekKey(deepSeekKey.value.trim()); deepSeekKey.value = ""; keyStatus.value = `已配置 · ${modelLabel(result.model)}`; notice.value = "DeepSeek 密钥已写入服务器 .env。"; }
async function refreshTaobaoStatus() { if (!taobaoSession.value) return; try { taobaoSession.value = await taobaoLoginStatus(taobaoSession.value.sessionId); taobaoScreenshotNonce.value = Date.now(); } catch { notice.value = "淘宝登录会话已过期，请重新打开。"; taobaoSession.value = null; } }
function startTaobaoPolling() { if (taobaoTimer) clearInterval(taobaoTimer); taobaoTimer = setInterval(() => { void refreshTaobaoStatus(); }, 3000); }
async function startTaobao() { taobaoBusy.value = true; notice.value = ""; try { taobaoSession.value = await startTaobaoLogin(); taobaoScreenshotNonce.value = Date.now(); startTaobaoPolling(); } catch (error) { notice.value = error instanceof Error ? error.message : "淘宝登录浏览器启动失败。"; } finally { taobaoBusy.value = false; } }
function browserPoint(event: PointerEvent) { const image = event.currentTarget as HTMLImageElement; const rect = image.getBoundingClientRect(); return { x: (event.clientX - rect.left) * (image.naturalWidth / rect.width), y: (event.clientY - rect.top) * (image.naturalHeight / rect.height) }; }
function startBrowserPointer(event: PointerEvent) { browserPointerStart = browserPoint(event); }
async function finishBrowserPointer(event: PointerEvent) { if (!taobaoSession.value || !browserPointerStart) return; const end = browserPoint(event); const start = browserPointerStart; browserPointerStart = null; const moved = Math.hypot(end.x - start.x, end.y - start.y) > 8; try { taobaoSession.value = await taobaoLoginAction(taobaoSession.value.sessionId, moved ? { action: "drag", ...start, endX: end.x, endY: end.y } : { action: "click", ...start }); taobaoScreenshotNonce.value = Date.now(); } catch (error) { notice.value = error instanceof Error ? error.message : "服务器浏览器操作失败。"; } }
async function sendTaobaoText() { if (!taobaoSession.value || !taobaoText.value) return; try { taobaoSession.value = await taobaoLoginAction(taobaoSession.value.sessionId, { action: "type", text: taobaoText.value }); taobaoText.value = ""; taobaoScreenshotNonce.value = Date.now(); } catch (error) { notice.value = error instanceof Error ? error.message : "文字输入失败。"; } }
async function sendTaobaoKey(key: string) { if (!taobaoSession.value) return; try { taobaoSession.value = await taobaoLoginAction(taobaoSession.value.sessionId, { action: "press", key }); taobaoScreenshotNonce.value = Date.now(); } catch (error) { notice.value = error instanceof Error ? error.message : "按键操作失败。"; } }
async function saveTaobao() { if (!taobaoSession.value) return; try { taobaoSession.value = await completeTaobaoLogin(taobaoSession.value.sessionId); notice.value = "淘宝登录状态已保存到服务器，后续提取会自动复用。"; } catch (error) { notice.value = error instanceof Error ? error.message : "淘宝登录状态尚未完成。"; } }
async function clearTaobao() { try { await clearTaobaoLogin(); taobaoSession.value = null; taobaoScreenshotNonce.value = 0; notice.value = "淘宝登录状态已清除。"; } catch (error) { notice.value = error instanceof Error ? error.message : "清除淘宝登录状态失败。"; } }
async function runAI() { if (!aiName.value.trim()) return; aiResult.value = await suggestGift(aiName.value, aiType.value); }
async function addField() { if (!field.machineKey || !field.displayName) return; await createCustomField({ machineKey: field.machineKey, displayName: field.displayName, valueType: field.valueType, cardinality: "single" }); notice.value = "自定义字段已添加。"; field.machineKey = ""; field.displayName = ""; await loadFields(); }
async function download(path: string, name: string) { const blob = await downloadBlob(path); const url = URL.createObjectURL(blob); const anchor = document.createElement("a"); anchor.href = url; anchor.download = name; anchor.click(); URL.revokeObjectURL(url); }
async function importExcel(event: Event) { const file = (event.target as HTMLInputElement).files?.[0]; if (file) { const result = await uploadFile("/api/import/xlsx", file); notice.value = `导入完成：${result.imported ?? 0} 条。`; } }
async function restoreBackup(event: Event) { const file = (event.target as HTMLInputElement).files?.[0]; if (file) { const result = await uploadFile("/api/restore", file); notice.value = `恢复完成：${result.restored ?? 0} 条。`; } }
async function analyzeLinks() {
  const urls = [...new Set(batchLinks.value.split(/\r?\n/).map((url) => url.trim()).filter(Boolean))].slice(0, 20);
  if (!urls.length) return;
  batchBusy.value = true; notice.value = "";
  try { batchItems.value = (await analyzeBatchLinks(urls, batchType.value)).items; }
  catch (error) { notice.value = error instanceof Error ? error.message : "批量链接解析失败。"; }
  finally { batchBusy.value = false; }
}
function serviceTone(ok: boolean) { return ok ? "status--ok" : "status--warn"; }
function taobaoStatusLabel(status: ServerStatus["taobao"]) { if (!status.enabled) return "已关闭"; if (!status.browserAvailable) return "浏览器不可用"; if (status.stateSaved) return "已保存登录"; return "未登录"; }
function extractionStatusLabel(status: string) { return ({ ok: "解析成功", challenge: "需要人工验证", browser_unavailable: "浏览器不可用", browser_error: "浏览器错误", timeout: "解析超时", blocked: "链接被拦截", error: "请求失败", unsupported: "格式不支持", too_large: "页面过大" } as Record<string, string>)[status] || status; }
function extractionTone(status: string) { return status === "ok" ? "status--ok" : "status--warn"; }
function formatPatchValue(value: unknown) { return Array.isArray(value) ? value.join("、") : typeof value === "boolean" ? (value ? "是" : "否") : String(value ?? "未识别"); }
async function reviewBatchItem(item: BatchLinkItem) {
  sessionStorage.setItem("giftmind.batchDraft", JSON.stringify({ giftTypeCode: batchType.value, ...item }));
  await router.push({ name: "gift-create" });
}
async function scanAllDuplicates() {
  duplicateScanDone.value = false;
  try { duplicatePairs.value = await scanGiftDuplicates(); duplicateScanDone.value = true; }
  catch (error) { notice.value = error instanceof Error ? error.message : "重复扫描失败。"; }
}
onMounted(async () => {
  void refreshServerStatus();
  try { await loadFields(); } catch { notice.value = "字段列表暂时无法加载，其他工具仍可使用。"; }
  try { const result = await deepSeekStatus(); keyStatus.value = `${result.configured ? "已配置" : "尚未配置"} · ${modelLabel(result.model)}`; } catch { if (!serverStatus.value) keyStatus.value = "暂时无法读取状态"; }
});
onUnmounted(() => { if (taobaoTimer) clearInterval(taobaoTimer); });
</script>

<style scoped>
.tools { display: grid; gap: 20px; }.heading p { margin: 0 0 6px; color: var(--color-accent); font-size: .8rem; font-weight: 800; }.heading h1 { margin: 0 0 8px; color: var(--color-ink); }.heading span, .card p { color: var(--color-ink-muted); }.notice { padding: 10px 12px; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); color: var(--color-primary); background: #e7f3e9; }.grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 16px; }.card { display: grid; align-content: start; gap: 12px; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: var(--color-surface); }.card--wide { grid-column: span 2; }.card h2 { margin: 0; color: var(--color-ink); font-size: 1.1rem; }.card input, .card select, .card textarea { min-height: 40px; padding: 9px 10px; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius-sm); font: inherit; }.card button { min-height: 40px; padding: 0 12px; border: 0; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); color: white; background: var(--color-primary); font-weight: 800; }.row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 8px; }.file { display: grid; gap: 6px; color: var(--color-primary); font-weight: 700; }.file input { padding: 8px; }.card ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 18px; color: var(--color-ink); }.card small { color: var(--color-ink-muted); }.batch-results { display: grid; gap: 10px; }.batch-results article { display: grid; gap: 6px; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius-sm); }.batch-results small { overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }.batch-results p { margin: 0; }.danger { color: #a62d28 !important; }.warning { color: #946516 !important; }pre { overflow: auto; padding: 10px; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); background: var(--color-surface-muted); }@media (max-width: 900px) { .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }.card--wide { grid-column: auto; } }
.taobao-login-card { margin-bottom: 0; }.taobao-login-actions, .taobao-browser-tools { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; align-items: center; }.taobao-login-actions .secondary { color: var(--color-primary); background: var(--color-surface-muted); }.taobao-login-status { display: grid; gap: 4px; margin: 0; }.taobao-login-status small { overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }.taobao-browser { display: grid; gap: 10px; max-width: 720px; padding: 10px; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius-sm); background: #f4f2eb; }.taobao-browser img { width: 100%; max-height: 520px; object-fit: contain; cursor: crosshair; background: white; }.taobao-browser-tools input { flex: 1; min-width: 220px; }.taobao-browser-tools button { min-height: 36px; font-size: .85rem; }
.server-status-card { gap: 16px; }.server-status-heading { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 18px; align-items: flex-start; }.server-status-heading p { margin: 0 0 5px; color: var(--color-accent); font-size: .75rem; font-weight: 800; }.server-status-heading h2 { margin: 0 0 5px; }.server-status-heading span { color: var(--color-ink-muted); font-size: .85rem; }.server-status-heading .secondary { color: var(--color-primary); background: var(--color-surface-muted); }.server-status-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 10px; }.server-status-item { display: grid; gap: 5px; padding: 13px; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius-sm); background: var(--color-surface-muted); }.server-status-item > span { color: var(--color-ink-muted); font-size: .8rem; font-weight: 700; }.server-status-item strong { font-size: 1rem; }.server-status-item small { color: var(--color-ink-muted); }.status--ok { color: #216844 !important; }.status--warn { color: #9a4038 !important; }.status-error { margin: 0; color: #a62d28 !important; }.status-chip { flex: none; align-self: flex-start; padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 999px; background: #f2efe4; font-size: .75rem; font-weight: 800; }.batch-result-heading { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; align-items: flex-start; }.batch-result-heading > div { display: grid; gap: 4px; min-width: 0; }.batch-result-heading strong { font-size: 1rem; }.batch-result-heading small { overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }.batch-source-meta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; color: var(--color-ink-muted); font-size: .75rem; }.batch-source { padding: 9px 10px; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: 9px; background: #fbfaf5; }.batch-source summary, .batch-fields summary { cursor: pointer; color: var(--color-primary); font-weight: 800; }.batch-source dl { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 80px 1fr; gap: 5px 9px; margin: 10p